>>__ load "simpLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_subgoaler`

``` hol4
simpLib.set_subgoaler : Traverse.subgoaler ->
  simpLib.simpset -> simpLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sets the procedure reducing side conditions before unsafe solvers run.
Its type is `Traverse.simp_prover_ctxt -> term -> thm`; it returns
`|- c = c'`. If `c'` is `T`, `c` is proved; otherwise unsafe solvers try
`c'`. The default simplifies recursively; after replacement the default
cannot be restored by this setter.

### Failure

Never fails at installation.

### Example

``` hol4
>> fun arith_subgoaler _ c = EQT_INTRO (DECIDE c);
>> simpLib.SIMP_CONV
     (simpLib.set_subgoaler arith_subgoaler boolSimps.bool_ss)
     [arithmeticTheory.LESS_MOD] “x MOD (x + 1)”;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpLib.set_cond_depth`](#simpLib.set_cond_depth).
